        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>8300 Series Heavy-Duty Grade 1 Rim Exit Device</b>\r\n<p>\r\nTell Manufacturing, Inc. was incorporated in 1986 as a manufacturer and distributor of commercial locks and door hardware. Tell has expanded its customer profiles to include, contract hardware distribution, locksmith distributors, OEM manufacturers, and the modular office industry.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThese Grade 1 Exit Devices   are popular with resort hotels, restaurants, schools  or anywhere you want to add a long lasting high quality exit device.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Certification: ANSI A156.3, 1994, Grade 1, UL Listed</li>\r\n<li><b>Rail: Fits 28\" to 36\" doors</b></li>\r\n<li>Latch: Stainless steel 5/8\" throw</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike: Adjustable with slotted holes for adjustments</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: Accomodates wood or metal doors</li>\r\n<li>Door Range: 1 3/4\" to 2\" thickness</li>\r\n<li>Door Preparation: Surface Mounted</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 10 year limited</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in aluminum Finish only:</b>\r\n</p>",
